+### Theorem 1 — Complete endomorphism set
+
+Every stable-color-preserving, part-preserving endomorphism of \(H\) is either the identity or
+
+\[
+r_I(i)=6-i,\qquad r_J(F_j)=F_{9-j}.
+\]
