+The image of \(F_4=134\) lies in \(\{F_4,F_5\}\). It contains the already fixed point \(1\), so it is \(F_4\), forcing \(f(4)=4\). Similarly, the image of \(F_5=235\) contains the fixed point \(2\), so it is \(F_5\), forcing \(f(5)=5\).
