+y_e\ge0,\qquad \sum_e y_e=1,
+\qquad
+\max_{C\text{ Hamiltonian}}\sum_{e\in C}y_e<\frac13.
+\]
+
+Any proposed distribution satisfying A would have expected \(y\)-weight at least \(1/3\), contradicting this bound.
