+### Exact B certificates
+
+Let \(c_I,c_J\) be the fully stabilized colors. For a stable-color-preserving point map \(f\), define
+
+\[
+D_j(f)=
+\left\{
+k:
+c_J(F_k)=c_J(F_j),\
+\{f(v):v\in F_j\}\subseteq F_k
+\right\}.
